# act (https://github.com/nektos/act) configuration
# This file is read automatically when you run `act` in this repo.
#
# -P <label>=<image>  Override the container image for a given runs-on label.
# --workdir           Set the working directory for act.
#
# Using node:22 for a modern base image; act installs the tools each workflow
# needs via its action steps (setup-php, setup-go, setup-java, etc.).
-P ubuntu-latest=node:22-bookworm-slim
--workdir .
